Capture, annotate and upload screenshots.

Usage: kropa [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  capture  Take a screenshot
  upload   Upload an existing file
  dest     Manage upload destinations
  secrets  Manage stored secrets
  queue    Manage the upload queue
  history  Browse captures and uploads
  edit     Open the editor on an image
  doctor   Report the system, its capabilities and active fallbacks
  version  Print version information

Options:
      --json             Machine-readable output: one JSON object on stdout
      --lang <LANG>      Language of messages (fr or en)
  -q, --quiet            Fewer messages on stderr (errors are kept)
  -v, --verbose...       More messages on stderr (-vv: debug log)
      --no-input         Never prompt, even on a terminal
      --color <COLOR>    Colour of stderr output: auto (default), always or never
      --config <DIR>     Configuration folder
      --password-fd <N>  Read the vault passphrase on this file descriptor
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
